    "text": "\u00d0is is seo socn into Scyreburna mid folcrihte, twa d\u00e6l of Cauda & Wicstow eal & ufer Seleby eal & twa\n& eall Luteringtun & eall Hehfer\u00f0eheg\u00f0e & eall Hudelestun.\nOn Scireburnan toecan \u00feam inlande syndan IIII hida weorclandes & on Luteringatune III hida & on\n& on Wicstowe twegea oxnagang & on Cawuda twa d\u00e6l \u00fe\u00e6s landes is agenland into Scireburnan &\nInto Ottanleage IIII plogaland & on B\u00e6geltune II, on Hafecesweor\u00f0e II, on o\u00f0eran Hafecesweor\u00f0e II,\n\u00deis is unbesacen agenland.\n& \u00fe\u00e6rto eacan hyra\u00f0 \u00feas socnland into Ottanleage, on Ottanleage II ploh & on B\u00e6ldune II & on\n\u00c6t Rypum \u00e6rest milegemet on \u00e6lce healfe.\n& Biscoptun is in on \u00feam II hida & Carlewic V hida & healf Munecatun his agenland feor\u00f0e healf hide\nOn Herelesho healf hid, on Stodlege III hida, on Su\u00f0tune o\u00feer healf hide, on Nunnewic III hida, on\n& \u00feys synd weste land, an is Sallege, o\u00f0er is Grantelege, \u00feridde is Efestun & feor\u00f0e is Wifeleshealh &\n\u00deonne syndan \u00feis preostaland, on Westwic IIII hida, on Nor\u00f0 Stanlege IIII, on Gy\u00f0ingdale I hide, on\n\u00d0is syndan socnland into Rypum, on Gy\u00feingadeal VIII hida & ofer eall Munecatun VII hida & on\n& on Su\u00f0tune o\u00f0er healf hide, on nyrran Stanlege V hida & on Nor\u00f0 Stanlege I hide & on Nunnewic I",
